The night dark was drawing back. Outlines of venerable trees surrounding you, could be seen more clearly; you could hear singing of first awaken birds, chirring of insects was coming from the grass. You need to keep moving, today it's necessary to get out of this forest and get back home at all costs; overnight stay clearly demonstrated, that there is no way of staying here. 
In a hurry you pack your stuff and start marching, trying to stick to some kind of path, treaded by wild animals. At least there is hope, that it'll lead you to a water source, and then you find the way out. 
You walked quite a long time, but the forest wouldn't end. Finally, gaps between trees became wider and you stepped to the edge. Unintentionally you let out a scream of joy: up ahead, in a low place, you could really discern a vague silhouette of some water body. But firstly you had to reach it. Savage trail was leading to another forest, smaller than the one you just passed. It consisted only of short shrubs. This underbrush was surrounded by fields with high grass. Gusts of wind swayed plants on the fields, you already saw yourself standing on a vast lakeside. Appears, it's time to choose, how is best to get to water.  